    <item>
      <title>在 Local 導入 Whisper 套件，用 Python 免費將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿！</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Apr 2023 12:26:52 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/</guid>
      <dc:creator>林鼎淵</dc:creator>
      <category>AI 實戰</category>
      <description>如果每次轉逐字稿都使用線上的 Whisper API 會快速消耗 OpenAI 的 Token，要是時常有轉長影片的需求，那可能得花不少錢在上面。 所以這篇文章筆者要向大家介紹如何在 Local 環境導入 Whisper 套件的方案，免費將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿！</description>
      <media:content url="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-og_hu_7619e0eeeb59e09f.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="675" />
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>如果每次轉逐字稿都使用線上的 Whisper API 會快速消耗 OpenAI 的 Token，要是時常有轉長影片的需求，那可能得花不少錢在上面（雖然他真的很方便）。</p>
<p>所以這篇文章筆者要向大家介紹如何在 Local 環境導入 Whisper 套件的方案，免費將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿！</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-01.webp" width="1291" height="711" alt="在 Local 導入 Whisper 套件，用 Python 免費將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿！（圖 1）" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></p>
<blockquote class="pullquote"><p>提醒大家，不要未經授權下載有版權保護的影片喔！</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>小提醒</strong>：雖然原則上按照步驟就能順利完成，但每個人的電腦環境會有些許差異，遇到特殊狀況時，請自行排除（或是問 ChatGPT）。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="觀看-whisper-官方文件">觀看 Whisper 官方文件<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e8%a7%80%e7%9c%8b-whisper-%e5%ae%98%e6%96%b9%e6%96%87%e4%bb%b6" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>GitHub 官網：<a href="https://github.com/openai/whisper">https://github.com/openai/whisper</a></p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-02.webp" width="1400" height="1061" alt="有興趣的朋友可以看圖片，來了解這款套件的訓練方式，這邊筆者就不再贅述。" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>有興趣的朋友可以看圖片，來了解這款套件的訓練方式，這邊筆者就不再贅述。</figcaption>
</figure>

<hr>
<h2 id="安裝-whisper-套件">安裝 Whisper 套件<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d-whisper-%e5%a5%97%e4%bb%b6" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p><strong>STEP 1</strong>：首先要特別注意的，就是目前這款套件是使用「Python 3.9.9」的版本，如果你安裝的是最新版的 Python，那後續連基礎的安裝就會失敗。</p>
<p>安裝 Python 3.9 版本：<code>brew install <a href="mailto:python@3.9">python@3.9</a></code></p>
<p><strong>STEP 2</strong>：如果你在 local 環境已經安裝了其他版本的 Python，就需要切換到 3.9 的版本才能夠順利執行後續安裝，建議直接改 alias 比較快。</p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>vi ~/.zshrc
alias python=&#39;python3.9&#39;
alias pip=&#39;pip3.9
</code></pre><p><strong>STEP 3</strong>：前面兩個步驟完成後，接下來安裝「通常」就會順利很多。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span style="display:flex;"><span>pip install torch torchvision torchaudio
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>pip install ffmpeg-python
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>pip install -U openai-whisper
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># windows (https://chocolatey.org/)可使用 choco install ffmpeg</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>brew install ffmpeg
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>pip install setuptools-rust
</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<p>如果想了解每個套件負責的任務是什麼，可以參考官網：<a href="https://github.com/openai/whisper#setup">https://github.com/openai/whisper#setup</a></p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>STEP 4</strong>：確認是否安裝成功。</p>
<p>在終端機輸入指令：<code>whisper &ndash;help</code>，如果出現下面的畫面就代表你安裝成功嚕！</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-03.webp" width="1400" height="640" alt="安裝 Whisper 套件（圖 3）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<hr>
<h2 id="用-whisper-套件將-youtube-影片轉換成逐字稿">用 Whisper 套件將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e7%94%a8-whisper-%e5%a5%97%e4%bb%b6%e5%b0%87-youtube-%e5%bd%b1%e7%89%87%e8%bd%89%e6%8f%9b%e6%88%90%e9%80%90%e5%ad%97%e7%a8%bf" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>筆者在<a href="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-to-mp3-with-chatgpt/">前面的文章</a>，已經完成將 Youtube 影片轉換成音檔的程式，接下來我們可以請 ChatGPT 幫我們做程式組合的任務。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>請自行安裝 pytube、pydub 的套件。</p>
</blockquote>
<p>😀：「下面是我用 Python 寫的 Youtube 影片轉成音檔的程式，我想要在這個基礎上擴充功能，我在後續的對話中會提出自己的需求，請問你可以幫忙嗎？</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pytube</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> YouTube
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pydub</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> AudioSegment
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 設定要下載的影片 URL</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>url <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IvOdTbIYZs4&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 建立 YouTube 物件</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>yt <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> YouTube(url)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 取得影片的音軌</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> yt<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>streams<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>filter(only_audio<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#79c0ff">True</span>)<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>first()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 下載音軌到指定的路徑</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>download(output_path<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory&#34;</span>, filename<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 讀取下載下來的音檔</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> AudioSegment<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>from_file(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 檢查音檔是否可以正常解碼</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(audio_file)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 將音檔轉換為 MP3 格式</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>mp3_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> audio_file<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>export(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio.mp3&#34;</span>, format<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;mp3&#34;</span>)
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-04.webp" width="1007" height="336" alt="用 Whisper 套件將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（圖 4）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>😀：「我找到了一個可以將 mp3 檔案轉成文字檔的套件，官方範例如下，我要如何將他與我現在的程式結合呢？</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">whisper</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>model <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> whisper<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>load_model(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;base&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>result <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> model<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>transcribe(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;audio.mp3&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(result[<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;text&#34;</span>])
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-05.webp" width="1007" height="806" alt="用 Whisper 套件將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（圖 5）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-06.webp" width="1007" height="734" alt="用 Whisper 套件將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（圖 6）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>我們在前面已經完成相關的套件安裝了，接下來直接嘗試看看 ChatGPT 組合後的程式是否靠譜。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pytube</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> YouTube
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pydub</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> AudioSegment
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">whisper</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 設定要下載的影片 URL</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>url <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IvOdTbIYZs4&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 建立 YouTube 物件</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>yt <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> YouTube(url)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 取得影片的音軌</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> yt<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>streams<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>filter(only_audio<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#79c0ff">True</span>)<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>first()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 下載音軌到指定的路徑</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>download(output_path<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory&#34;</span>, filename<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 讀取下載下來的音檔</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> AudioSegment<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>from_file(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 檢查音檔是否可以正常解碼</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(audio_file)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 將音檔轉換為 MP3 格式</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>mp3_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> audio_file<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>export(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio.mp3&#34;</span>, format<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;mp3&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 讀取 MP3 檔案，轉成文字檔案</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>model <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> whisper<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>load_model(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;base&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>result <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> model<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>transcribe(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio.mp3&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(result[<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;text&#34;</span>])
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>SETP 1</strong>：建立一個<code>youtube-local-whisper.py</code>的檔案，貼上 ChatGPT 的程式。</p>
<p><strong>SETP 2</strong>：在終端機輸入<code>python youtube-local-whisper.py</code>，然後稍等一段時間&hellip;就可以見證奇蹟啦！</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-07.webp" width="1400" height="840" alt="儘管有成功轉換逐字稿，但這個品質真的有點悲劇。" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>儘管有成功轉換逐字稿，但這個品質真的有點悲劇。</figcaption>
</figure>

<hr>
<h2 id="提升轉出的逐字稿品質">提升轉出的逐字稿品質<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e6%8f%90%e5%8d%87%e8%bd%89%e5%87%ba%e7%9a%84%e9%80%90%e5%ad%97%e7%a8%bf%e5%93%81%e8%b3%aa" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>在程式中，預設的 model 是 base 模型，實際上他有提供這些模型供我們選擇：「tiny/base/small/medium/large」</p>
<p>不過越往上，對電腦的需求越高，花費時間越多，我們可以先看一下官方提供的對照表：</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-08.webp" width="1400" height="391" alt="提升轉出的逐字稿品質（圖 8）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>除了 model 的選擇外，另一個是「語言」，如果一開始有設定好也能提升辨識的準確度（ex：中文是「zh」）。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>有興趣的朋友可以看一下套件目前提供的語言列表：<a href="https://github.com/openai/whisper/blob/main/whisper/tokenizer.py">https://github.com/openai/whisper/blob/main/whisper/tokenizer.py</a></p>
</blockquote>
<p>下面是筆者將語言調整成「zh」，並選擇「medium」這個 Model 優化的程式（除非你電腦性能超級優秀，否則選擇 large 會等到天荒地老）：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pytube</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> YouTube
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pydub</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> AudioSegment
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">whisper</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 設定要下載的影片 URL</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>url <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IvOdTbIYZs4&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 建立 YouTube 物件</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>yt <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> YouTube(url)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 取得影片的音軌</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> yt<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>streams<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>filter(only_audio<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#79c0ff">True</span>)<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>first()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 下載音軌到指定的路徑</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>download(output_path<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory&#34;</span>, filename<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 讀取下載下來的音檔</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> AudioSegment<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>from_file(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 檢查音檔是否可以正常解碼</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(audio_file)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 將音檔轉換為 MP3 格式</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>mp3_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> audio_file<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>export(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio.mp3&#34;</span>, format<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;mp3&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 讀取 MP3 檔案，轉成文字檔案</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>model <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> whisper<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>load_model(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;medium&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>result <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> model<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>transcribe(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio.mp3&#34;</span>, language<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;zh&#39;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(result[<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;text&#34;</span>])
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>這次輸出的結果總算是比較接近預期的了（真的要等一段時間喔…）。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-09.webp" width="1400" height="868" alt="提升轉出的逐字稿品質（圖 9）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>如果覺得看起來眼花，那就交給 ChatGPT 幫你整理一下吧！</p>
<p>😀：「幫我改錯字、分段、加標點符號，讓內容更通順：[逐字稿]」</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/local-whisper-youtube-transcript/images/local-whisper-youtube-transcript-10.webp" width="1021" height="709" alt="大家可以發現裡面的文字不是百分百正確，品質還是需要自己把關的喔！" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>大家可以發現裡面的文字不是百分百正確，品質還是需要自己把關的喔！</figcaption>
</figure>

<hr>
<h2 id="結論優化還是需要一定的專業水平">結論：優化還是需要一定的專業水平<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e7%b5%90%e8%ab%96%e5%84%aa%e5%8c%96%e9%82%84%e6%98%af%e9%9c%80%e8%a6%81%e4%b8%80%e5%ae%9a%e7%9a%84%e5%b0%88%e6%a5%ad%e6%b0%b4%e5%b9%b3" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>如果是一個 0 基礎的人，我會更建議使用筆者的<a href="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/">另外一篇文章</a>，來實作 Youtube 轉逐字稿的功能。</p>
<p>因為在 Local 環境導入 Whisper 真的還是有一些技術門檻，光是環境設定的部分，就可能讓沒經驗的人經歷「困惑 ➝ 絕望 ➝ 投降」的 3 個階段；不過，如果能順利設定完成，那將給自己帶來巨大的成就感。</p>
<p>儘管初步的程式，我們可以靠 ChatGPT 幫我們組合出來；但因為 Whisper 畢竟是一款新的套件，如果想要對他優化，還是需要具備閱讀技術文件的能力。</p>
<p>有了 AI 輔助，工程師就能把更多的精力放在優化而非基礎建設上，相信在不久的將來，M 型化會越來越明顯。</p>
<hr>
