    <item>
      <title>進階應用！詢問 ChatGPT 如何用 Python 將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（OpenAI 的 whisper）</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Mar 2023 13:50:25 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/</guid>
      <dc:creator>林鼎淵</dc:creator>
      <category>AI 實戰</category>
      <description>上一篇文章中，筆者靠 ChatGPT 成功將 Youtube 影片轉換成音檔（mp3），在這篇文章中，我會分享如何用 OpenAI 提供的 whisper api 將 音檔轉成逐字稿。</description>
      <media:content url="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/images/python-youtube-transcript-whisper-og_hu_9bafd8c18cd77190.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="675" />
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-to-mp3-with-chatgpt/">上一篇文章中</a>，筆者靠 ChatGPT 成功將 Youtube 影片轉換成音檔（mp3），在這篇文章中，我會分享如何用 OpenAI 提供的 whisper api 將 音檔轉成逐字稿。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>如果沒有程式基礎的朋友，建議先從<a href="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-to-mp3-with-chatgpt/">上一篇文章</a>開始閱讀。</p>
</blockquote>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/images/python-youtube-transcript-whisper-01.webp" width="1289" height="717" alt="進階應用！詢問 ChatGPT 如何用 Python 將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（OpenAI 的 whisper）（圖 1）" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></p>
<blockquote class="pullquote"><p><em>提醒大家，不要未經授權下載有版權保護的影片喔！</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p>目前的 ChatGPT 資料截止於 2021 年 9 月，如果用到最近才新增的技術，我們還是要先到官網查看文件。</p>
<p>OpenAI 技術文件：<a href="https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/speech-to-text">https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/speech-to-text</a></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/images/python-youtube-transcript-whisper-02.webp" width="1400" height="906" alt="進階應用！詢問 ChatGPT 如何用 Python 將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（OpenAI 的 whisper）（圖 2）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>儘管 ChatGPT 不知道未來世界的資料，但我們還是可以請他幫我們將程式重組。</p>
<p>😀：「下面是我用 Python 寫的 Youtube 影片轉成音檔的程式，我想要在這個基礎上擴充功能，我在後續的對話中會提出自己的需求，請問你可以幫忙嗎？</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pytube</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> YouTube
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pydub</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> AudioSegment
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 設定要下載的影片 URL</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>url <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IvOdTbIYZs4&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 建立 YouTube 物件</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>yt <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> YouTube(url)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 取得影片的音軌</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> yt<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>streams<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>filter(only_audio<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#79c0ff">True</span>)<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>first()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 下載音軌到指定的路徑</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>download(output_path<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory&#34;</span>, filename<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 讀取下載下來的音檔</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> AudioSegment<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>from_file(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 檢查音檔是否可以正常解碼</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(audio_file)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 將音檔轉換為 MP3 格式</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>mp3_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> audio_file<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>export(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio.mp3&#34;</span>, format<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;mp3&#34;</span>)
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/images/python-youtube-transcript-whisper-03.webp" width="1012" height="445" alt="進階應用！詢問 ChatGPT 如何用 Python 將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（OpenAI 的 whisper）（圖 3）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>😀：「我找到了一個可以將 mp3 檔案轉成文字檔的套件，官方範例如下，我要如何將他與我現在的程式結合呢？</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">openai</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_file<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> open(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;/path/to/file/audio.mp3&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;rb&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>transcript <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> openai<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>Audio<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>transcribe(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;whisper-1&#34;</span>, audio_file)
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/images/python-youtube-transcript-whisper-04.webp" width="1012" height="728" alt="進階應用！詢問 ChatGPT 如何用 Python 將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（OpenAI 的 whisper）（圖 4）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/images/python-youtube-transcript-whisper-05.webp" width="1012" height="445" alt="進階應用！詢問 ChatGPT 如何用 Python 將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（OpenAI 的 whisper）（圖 5）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>有了 ChatGPT 的提示後，我們可以按照下面的步驟操作。</p>
<p><strong>SETP 1</strong>：安裝新套件：<code>pip3 install openai</code>。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>如果上一篇文章沒有安裝到，請記得順便安裝不然會有錯誤訊息喔：<code>pip install pydub pytube</code></p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>SETP 2</strong>：建立一個檔案<code>youtube-to-text.py</code>，然後貼上 ChatGPT 提供的程式。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pytube</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> YouTube
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pydub</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> AudioSegment
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">openai</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 設定要下載的影片 URL</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>url <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IvOdTbIYZs4&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 建立 YouTube 物件</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>yt <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> YouTube(url)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 取得影片的音軌</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> yt<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>streams<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>filter(only_audio<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#79c0ff">True</span>)<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>first()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 下載音軌到指定的路徑</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>download(output_path<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory&#34;</span>, filename<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 讀取下載下來的音檔</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> AudioSegment<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>from_file(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 將音檔轉換為 WAV 格式</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>wav_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> audio_file<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>export(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio.wav&#34;</span>, format<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;wav&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 使用 OpenAI 的 Audio API 將音檔轉成文字</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>openai<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>api_key <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;YOUR_API_KEY&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">with</span> open(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio.wav&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;rb&#34;</span>) <span style="color:#ff7b72">as</span> f:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    transcript <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> openai<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>Audio<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>transcribe(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;whisper-1&#34;</span>, f)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 印出轉換後的文字</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(transcript)
</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<p>我們原本是將 Youtube 轉換成 mp3 檔，而這次 ChatGPT 改寫的過程中，把它轉換成了 wav 檔；並且對我們提供的範例程式做了一定程度的改寫（ex：告訴我們要自己填入”YOUR_API_KEY”）。</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>SETP 3</strong>：請先去 <a href="https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys">https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys</a> 申請自己的 API Key，將 YOUR_API_KEY 替換成自己的。</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>小提醒：</strong>將 API Key 放入環境變數的作法更好，不過這篇文章以 Demo 目的為主，讀者切記不要把自己的 API Key 洩露出去了。</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>SETP 4</strong>：輸入 <code>python youtube-to-text.py</code> 執行程式，結果遇到了錯誤如下：</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/images/python-youtube-transcript-whisper-06.webp" width="1400" height="574" alt="進階應用！詢問 ChatGPT 如何用 Python 將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（OpenAI 的 whisper）（圖 6）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>看不懂錯誤訊息沒關係，直接貼到 ChatGPT。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/images/python-youtube-transcript-whisper-07.webp" width="1001" height="746" alt="進階應用！詢問 ChatGPT 如何用 Python 將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（OpenAI 的 whisper）（圖 7）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202303/python-youtube-transcript-whisper/images/python-youtube-transcript-whisper-08.webp" width="860" height="756" alt="進階應用！詢問 ChatGPT 如何用 Python 將 Youtube 影片轉換成逐字稿（OpenAI 的 whisper）（圖 8）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>原來是檔案大小的問題，這邊筆者將 10 秒的時間拉長到 100 秒，避免聲音切割過度。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pytube</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> YouTube
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">from</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">pydub</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> AudioSegment
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">import</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">openai</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 設定要下載的影片 URL</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>url <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IvOdTbIYZs4&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 建立 YouTube 物件</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>yt <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> YouTube(url)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 取得影片的音軌</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> yt<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>streams<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>filter(only_audio<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#79c0ff">True</span>)<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>first()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 下載音軌到指定的路徑</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_stream<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>download(output_path<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory&#34;</span>, filename<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 讀取下載下來的音檔</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>audio_file <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> AudioSegment<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>from_file(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;path/to/save/directory/audio&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 切割音檔成多個小檔案</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>chunk_size <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">100</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">*</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">1000</span>  <span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 100 秒</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>chunks <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> [audio_file[i:i<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">+</span>chunk_size] <span style="color:#ff7b72">for</span> i <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">in</span> range(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">0</span>, len(audio_file), chunk_size)]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 使用 OpenAI 的 Audio API 將每個小檔案轉成文字，然後合併在一起</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>openai<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>api_key <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;YOUR_API_KEY&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>transcript <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">for</span> chunk <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">in</span> chunks:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#ff7b72">with</span> chunk<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>export(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;temp.wav&#34;</span>, format<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;wav&#34;</span>) <span style="color:#ff7b72">as</span> f:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        result <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> openai<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>Audio<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">.</span>transcribe(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;whisper-1&#34;</span>, f)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        transcript <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">+=</span> result[<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;text&#34;</span>]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"># 印出轉換後的文字</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(transcript)
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>再輸入一次 <code>python youtube-to-text.py</code> 執行程式，接著就順利取得逐字稿啦！！！！</p>
